The FEC is a C port of the voice frame decoder in jr-conventional-line-radio-receiver
(https://github.com/soltia48/jr-conventional-line-radio-receiver,
crates/receiver-core/src/voice_frame.rs and coding.rs, commit 9945870).
It is distributed under the MIT license reproduced below; the port and its
changes are under the same license.

